1 NOTE {geni:about_me} There is a mysterious Johan Jakobsson, whose birth record is not found.  It is later said that he was born in 1749, but that is hardly possible. He had three brother who all died in childhood:  25.12.1748	1748	Lars
2 CONC må	Nybond	Jacob Jacobsson Margeta Matzdr. Matz d 1749 nybond 24.4.1750	26.4.1750	Larsmå	Slusnäs	Jacob Jacobss. Margeta Matzdr. Erich d 1750 19.1.1753	20.1.1753	Larsmo	Slussnäs	Jacob Jacobi Margareta Mathiae Anders d 1753
2 CONT
2 CONT Johan can hardly fit in between 25.2.1748 and 24.4.1750, there is only 16 months time for two pregnancies after Matts to have Johan and Erik.  If Johan was born between Erik and Anders, where the gap is 33 months, the proper birth
2 CONC  year is 1751.
2 CONT
2 CONT Johan was in confirmation class in 1770, being 19 years of age, which is unusually old.
