2 CONT
2 CONT Facts supporting the theory that Lars Jakobsson Litens and Lauri Jaakonpoika Kultalahti of Evijarvi are the same person:
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Lars came from Evijarvi when he married Maria Mattsdotter in Larsmo 1730.
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. The only Lars Jakobsson born in Evijarvi between 1700 and 1711 is the son of Jakob Monsson Kultalahi.
2 CONT
2 CONT 3. Lars had a daughter Beata born in Larsmo 1731. (Mother's name wrongly written Beata, should be Maria).
2 CONT
2 CONT 4. Hans Jakobsson and Maria are listed under Jakob Kultalahti. There was no Hans, should be Lars. Maria was "inflyttad"
2 CONT
2 CONT 5. Lars and Maria had a daughter Lisa in 1736, when they lived in Pundarniemi, near Kultalahti. Lisa is later listed in Larsmo.
2 CONT
2 CONT 6. Lars and Maria moved to Litens, Larsmo in the late 1730ies and then hade more children.
2 CONT
2 CONT Conclusion: Lars Jakobsson Litens and Lauri Jaakonpoika Kultalahti meged, August 18th, 2021. (KGS)
