1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Substantiation for a theory that Susanna Pehrsdotter Storkalll was the daughter of Pehr Martinsson Giers/Korri/Nelimarkka:
2 CONT
2 CONT 1) Pehr had a son Matts Pehrsson, born 1712 in Lappajarvi and a daughter Lisa Pehrsdotter, born 1725 in Pedersore. It is likely that he had other children in between, also after moving to Pedersore before 1720.  If there was a Sus
2 CONC anna born before 1722, she would not be in the Pedersore birth records, which start in 1722.
2 CONT
2 CONT 2) There is a fl Susanna in the Pedersore Giers records, starting 5.12.1736.  She disappears after 26.12.1742.
2 CONT KB 1736-1743 digi 140 s 154 Lepplax, Giers Joran Sim , mag per Mart , hu Lisa , 
2 CONT <son Matts, h Lisa, 
2 CONT fl Susanna, dott Lisa> Mxx , yyy , dreng Johan xxxsson 
2 CONT https://digihakemisto.net/item/1284934866/6038760292/140
2 CONT
2 CONT In the following record it almost looks like Susanna was written but then overwritten by Lisa:
2 CONT digi 297 s 314 1744-1751 Lepplax, Giers , Per Mattss, hu Lisa, son Matz, hu Lisa, dott Lisusanna, 
2 CONT son Joh Matzson , xxx , zzz
2 CONT https://digihakemisto.net/item/1284934866/6038760184/297
2 CONT
2 CONT 3) Susanna obviously got married to Johan Jakobsson Storkall in 1743, for which year Pedersore has no marriage records. A Susanna is found in the Storkall records together with Johan from 14.5.1744.
2 CONT digi 235 s 252 1744-1751 Caternö, Stor Kåll , .... , Jac J , hu m , son J J , hu SUSANNA , ...
2 CONT https://digihakemisto.net/item/1284934866/6038760721/235
2 CONT
2 CONT 4) Johan's mother tongue was finnish, so it is likely that he married a girl with finnish mother tongue. His younger brother Jakob Jakobsson later married Lisa Pehrsdotter Giers, who's mother tongue was finnish.
2 CONT
2 CONT 5) Susanna and Johan had their first child in 1744.  One of the sponsors was Lisa Pehrsdotter, then still a single girl. It would be logical for Susanna to have Lisa as a sponsor, if they were sisters. Later Johan/Susanna and Jako
2 CONC b/Lisa mutually sponsored the other couple's children.
2 CONT Pedersöre - döpta
2 CONT Född	Döpt	By	Gård	Far	Mor	Barn
2 CONT 10.6.1744	1744	Caternö	Stor Kåll	Johan Jacobsson  	Susanna Persdr.  	Maria
2 CONT 15.3.1747	1747	Caternö	Stor Kåll	Johan Jacobss.  	Susanna Persdr.  	Brita
2 CONT 22.3.1749 23.3.1749	Caternö	Stor Kåll	Joh. Jacobss.  	Susanna Persdr.  	Helena: tvill.
2 CONT 22.3.1749 23.3.1749	Caternö	Stor Kåll	Joh. Jacobss.  	Susanna Perdr.  	Brita    : tvill.
2 CONT 28.5.1751 31.5.1751	Katernö	Storkåll	Johan Jacobi  	Susanna Petri  	Susanna
2 CONT 24.11.1754 27.11.1754	Caternö	Storkåll	Johan Jacobsson  	Susanna Pehrsdr.  	Johan
2 CONT 28.10.1757 28.10.1757	Cathernö	Storkåll	Johan Jacobsson  	Susanna Pehrsdr.  	Jacob
2 CONT
2 CONT 6) Susanna died in 1759 by drowning, aged 38.  She was born in 1720/1721 and confirmed about 1736.
2 CONT Pedersöre - begravda
2 CONT Död	Begravd	By	Gård	Person	Dödsorsak	år	m.	v.	d.
2 CONT 2.11.1759 1759 Cathernö St.Kåll Hust. Susanna Pehrsdotter  drunkn.	38	 	 	 original - PIK: G
2 CONT
2 CONT 7) The name Susanna was common in the Giers/Korri family:
2 CONT Susanna Martinsdotter b 1694 Susanna Mattsdotter b 1739
