1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Matts Eriksson Mietala (Kaukos) Farm owner on Kaukos farm. Born 24.10.1830 on Mietala farm, Jeppo parish, now part of Nykarleby. Married 31.04.1853 to Maria (Maja) Jakobsdotter Kaukos. Died 26.10.1873 on Kaukos far
2 CONC m, Jeppo parish. He and his wife bought the farm in 1858.
2 CONT
2 CONT His son Johannes (John) Mattson referred to him as Matts Mattson on his 1919 passport application.
